First release of HivePulse.

Scan the QR code on a hive, log the visit, done: frames, queen, temperament, varroa, treatments, feed, notes. Big buttons, so it works with gloves on. Works without a signal.

New: a home screen with what is due, planned treatments, moving hives to the bloom with a map, and working on an apiary together with another beekeeper.

Tell us what was confusing: hivepulse@multihead.de
